    {
      "text": "His use of Turn Rock Gu for desert building makes him popular, and he receives gratitude from the people. He is kind hearted but not resolute, loves his family, and dotes on his granddaughter the most; Fang Yuan judges that holding that granddaughter hostage would make him comply.",
